meta {
  name: Get Job Applications
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}/applications?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~status: submitted
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  ## RS-030 — Get Job Applications API

  Returns a paginated list of applications for a specific job posting owned by the authenticated recruiter.

  ### Requirements & Features
  - Requires recruiter Bearer token authentication.
  - Verifies the recruiter owns the job (returns **404** if not found or not owned).
  - Supports pagination (`page`, `limit`).
  - Supports status filtering (`submitted`, `under_review`, `shortlisted`, `interview`, `rejected`).
  - Returns candidate info (`full_name`, `email`, `phone`, `linkedin_url`, `github_url`), resume details, status, and submission date (`created_at`).

  ### Path Parameters
  | Param  | Type   | Description            |
  |--------|--------|------------------------|
  | job_id | UUID   | UUID of the job posting |

  ### Query Parameters
  | Param  | Type    | Default | Description                                                        |
  |--------|---------|---------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page   | integer | 1       | 1-based page number                                                |
  | limit  | integer | 10      | Items per page (max 100)                                           |
  | status | string  | —       | Filter by status (`submitted`, `under_review`, `shortlisted`, etc.) |
}
